  "summary": "Rear lighting, all models: the round tail/stop/turn signal lamps (taillights) and back-up lamps (reverse lights) in the body rear lower panel, the rear side marker lamps in the rear quarter panels, the license lamp, and the body rear harness that feeds them. The tail and back-up lamps have their own threaded studs that pass through the rear panel and take nuts with special washers from inside; the marker lamp also has its own studs with nuts. The harness is clipped with a screw at the lamp monitor, and an LH-only ground lead screws to the frame.",
